method.description:
Set this on both peers. Calls [param handler] on the joining peer with the challenge the server reads as [member NetwJoinRequest.challenge]. Over WebRTC and Steam both peers bind it to the server the peer is connected to, as [member NetwJoinRequest.challenge_bound] reports. Its result becomes [member NetwJoinRequest.proof]. The handler may [code]await[/code] or return a [NetwPromise]. Return a [Variant] that can be sent with [method @GlobalScope.var_to_bytes].
[codeblock]
func prove(challenge: String) -> Variant:
    return await identity.prove(challenge)
[/codeblock]
